  "details": "This report is a bit ephemeral since it's concerning joining a specific instance that may not exist in the future.\n\nWhen trying to join this specific instance \n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_b36fc6a5-7b8f-4390-a6d1-b49485f4eef0&instanceId=ComfySleepyHeads~group(grp_a0d29379-f15c-4f79-9b43-41e2b631a2b0)~groupAccessType(public)~region(eu)\n\nyou get put in to a connection loop and eventually sent to the local error world. Creating a new instance of the same world works. Joining it using live version works. Trying to join it on open beta with a different account doesn't work.\n\nEdit: this was probably because the instance was made in an earlier version and open beta wasn't compatible with it anymore.",
